{% comment %}
  A full-width band: one image half, one copy half on a warm ground.

  Used twice on the product page - "Made in small batches" and "The Tabi Way" -
  which is why it is one configurable section rather than two hardcoded ones.
  The two differ in image side, split ratio, whether there is a link, and which
  decorative artwork sits in the corner, and all four are settings.

  The copy is brand level, identical on every product, so it lives in section
  settings rather than metafields. A merchant edits it once per template.

  The corner decoration is one of two things, chosen per band:

  - an uploaded image (the botanical sprig), presentation only - hidden below
    990px where it would crowd the text, and carrying an empty alt so screen
    readers skip it; or
  - the drawn TABI seal, whose ring of text turns slowly around a still name
    and stops when a visitor hovers it. Drawn rather than uploaded so both
    lines of its wording stay theme settings - see snippets/pdp-seal.liquid.

  The setting defaults to the image, so a band saved before the seal existed
  keeps rendering exactly what it rendered then.
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'product-page.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign media_right = false
  if section.settings.image_position == 'right'
    assign media_right = true
  endif

  case section.settings.split
    when 'even'
      assign split = '1fr 1fr'
    when 'media_wide'
      assign split = '1.2fr 1fr'
    when 'media_narrow'
      assign split = '0.8fr 1fr'
    else
      assign split = '1fr 1fr'
  endcase

  comment
    The grid columns are written media-first. When the image is on the right the
    CSS reorders the two halves rather than flipping the track list, so this
    ratio always describes "image column, then text column".
  endcomment
  if media_right
    assign split = split | split: ' ' | reverse | join: ' '
  endif

  comment
    With no image there is one child to place, and a two-track grid seats the
    copy in the first track and leaves the second as an empty stretch of beige -
    45% of the band on desktop, at every width above 750px. Collapse to a single
    column so the band reads as a plain text band until the photograph is set.
  endcomment
  if section.settings.image == blank
    assign split = '1fr'
  endif
-%}

<div
  class="pdp-section color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }}"
  style="--pdp-pad-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px; --pdp-pad-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;"
>
  <div class="pdp-section__inner">
    <div
      class="pdp-band__inner{% if media_right %} pdp-band--media-right{% endif %}{% if section.settings.mobile_text_first %} pdp-band--mobile-text-first{% endif %}"
      style="--pdp-band-split: {{ split }}; --pdp-decor-size: {{ section.settings.decor_width }}rem;"
    >
      {%- if section.settings.image != blank -%}
        <div class="pdp-band__media">
          {{
            section.settings.image
            | image_url: width: 1400
            | image_tag:
              loading: 'lazy',
              sizes: '(min-width: 750px) 50vw, 100vw',
              widths: '400, 600, 800, 1000, 1200, 1400',
              alt: section.settings.image.alt
          }}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="pdp-band__content">
        {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
          <p class="pdp-eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
          <h2 class="pdp-display">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.body != blank -%}
          <div class="pdp-band__body rte">{{ section.settings.body }}</div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%}
          Label and URL are both required - see the same note in
          sections/pdp-approach.liquid. A link with only a label rendered as
          href="#" and scrolled to the top of the page instead of going
          anywhere.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if section.settings.link_label != blank and section.settings.link_url != blank -%}
          <div class="pdp-band__link">
            <a class="pdp-link" href="{{ section.settings.link_url }}">
              <span>{{ section.settings.link_label | escape }}</span>
              {%- render 'pdp-icon', icon: 'arrow' -%}
            </a>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%}
          The decoration comes last because on a phone the seal is the one
          decoration that stays in the flow, and it belongs after the copy
          rather than shouldering in above the eyebrow. The uploaded image is
          out of flow at every width it is visible at - absolute from 990px,
          hidden below - so sitting here changes nothing for that branch.

          `decor_style` is nil on every band saved before the seal existed, and
          Liquid reads nil as "not 'seal'", so those fall through to the image
          branch and render exactly what they always did.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if section.settings.decor_style == 'seal' -%}
          <div class="pdp-band__seal">
            {%- render 'pdp-seal',
              name: section.settings.seal_name,
              text_top: section.settings.seal_text_top,
              text_bot: section.settings.seal_text_bottom,
              speed: section.settings.seal_speed,
              direction: section.settings.seal_direction,
              uid: section.id
            -%}
          </div>
        {%- elsif section.settings.decor_style != 'none' and section.settings.decor_image != blank -%}
          {{
            section.settings.decor_image
            | image_url: width: 400
            | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', class: 'pdp-band__decor', alt: ''
          }}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "PDP: Feature band",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "pdp-section-wrapper",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image",
      "label": "Image"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "image_position",
      "label": "Image position",
      "default": "left",
      "options": [
        { "value": "left", "label": "Left" },
        { "value": "right", "label": "Right" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "split",
      "label": "Image width",
      "default": "even",
      "options": [
        { "value": "media_narrow", "label": "Narrow" },
        { "value": "even", "label": "Half" },
        { "value": "media_wide", "label": "Wide" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "mobile_text_first",
      "label": "Show text before image on mobile",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "Small label",
      "default": "Made in small batches"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Made in small batches."
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "body",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Made thoughtfully, in limited runs and often to order.</p><p>Less excess. More intention.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Link"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "link_label",
      "label": "Link label"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "link_url",
      "label": "Link"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Decoration"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "decor_style",
      "label": "Corner decoration",
      "default": "image",
      "info": "The uploaded image is hidden on screens under 990px. The turning seal is not — it moves below the text there instead.",
      "options": [
        { "value": "image", "label": "Uploaded image" },
        { "value": "seal", "label": "Turning TABI seal" },
        { "value": "none", "label": "None" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "decor_width",
      "min": 4,
      "max": 22,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "rem",
      "label": "Decoration width",
      "default": 9
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "decor_image",
      "label": "Decorative image",
      "info": "Used when the decoration above is set to Uploaded image."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Turning seal"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Each line is spaced to fill its half of the ring, so both stay evenly set whatever you type. Around 16 to 22 characters a line reads best; much shorter and the letters spread very wide."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "seal_name",
      "label": "Name in the middle",
      "default": "Tabi",
      "info": "Stays still while the ring turns. Shown uppercase."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "seal_text_top",
      "label": "Top line",
      "default": "A place to belong",
      "info": "Shown uppercase. Leave empty to hide this half of the ring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "seal_text_bottom",
      "label": "Bottom line",
      "default": "A place to belong"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "seal_speed",
      "min": 8,
      "max": 60,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "s",
      "label": "Seconds per turn",
      "default": 28,
      "info": "Higher is slower. The ring stops while a visitor hovers it, and does not turn at all for visitors who ask for reduced motion."
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "seal_direction",
      "label": "Direction",
      "default": "clockwise",
      "options": [
        { "value": "clockwise", "label": "Clockwise" },
        { "value": "anticlockwise", "label": "Anticlockwise" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.all.colors.label"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "t:sections.all.colors.label",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.all.padding.section_padding_heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "t:sections.all.padding.padding_top",
      "default": 48
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "t:sections.all.padding.padding_bottom",
      "default": 48
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "PDP: Feature band"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
